    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "一个看似专业的名字「遗传算法」，背后藏着怎样一个直观问题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "在深度学习主导 AI 之前，搜索是这个领域的核心隐喻之一。霍兰德 将生物适应引入计算，使研究人工种群中的学习与优化成为可能。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-adaptation-in-natural-and-artificial-systems"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-ai100-achievement", "claim-method-artifact"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "遗传算法不是直接改进单个解，而是反复评分、选择、重组和变异候选解，让一个种群逐步演化。这种群体式搜索能够同时探索多个候选方向，并通过选择压力保留更有希望的结构。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-adaptation-in-natural-and-artificial-systems"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-ai100-achievement", "claim-method-artifact"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把遗传算法视为困难设计空间中的有用搜索启发式方法，而不是通用智能理论。它们的长期影响在于基于种群的探索，适用于没有梯度、目标函数棘手或候选设计需要演化的任务。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-adaptation-in-natural-and-artificial-systems"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-ai100-achievement", "claim-method-artifact"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "「遗传算法」留下的关键，不只是一项成果，而是一种后来可以继续检验、改造和扩展的方法。",
            "sourceIds": [
                "source-deap-evolutionary-computation-framework",
                "source-ecj-evolutionary-computation-system",
                "source-adaptation-in-natural-and-artificial-systems"
            ],
            "claimIds": ["claim-ai100-achievement", "claim-method-artifact"],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-closing"
        }
    ]
